  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshops Anticorruption</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Workshops Antikorruption</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During 2009 the Dept for Methodologies and Effectiveness will carry out context specific workshops on anti-corruption for the country categories. Component 01 refers to workshops with the Dept for Conflict countries and the Civil Society Team respectively. The workshops will be done jointly with TIRI who have expertise in the area of post- war reconstruction.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Under 2009 kommer Metodavdelningen att i enlighet med sin OP genomf&#xf6;ra kontextspecifika anti-korruptionsworkshops f&#xf6;r de olika l&#xe4;nderkategorierna. Komponent 01 avser workshops dels med konflikavdelningen och dels med Team CIVSAM. Genomf&#xf6;rs i samarbete med TIRI som har expertis p&#xe5; omr&#xe5;det integritet i &#xe5;teruppbyggnad efter krig.</narrative>
  </description>
